From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:43:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: sg-pc CG LIBRARY, SOUND LIBRARY and CLEAR LIST ported
 from Game.exe

CG LIBRARY (10:1F, 0x415e90 / 0x4168f0 / 0x417060, drawn by 0x415dc0 /
0x4161b0 / 0x416e90): the album table 0x5280f8, pages of twelve groups with
the seen / total counts, the viewer with zoom, drag and the cross fade
between pictures that the script loads (flags 1341 / 1342).
SOUND LIBRARY (10:1D, 0x436b30 / 0x436c70, drawn by 0x4374f0): the 35
tracks of 0x52befc with the unlocks of 0x436890, stop and the four play
modes.
CLEAR LIST (drawn by 0x433db0, values of 0x434680): play time, endings,
tips and the share of seen CGs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

